For quite a while now, I've given up playing the same character with the same
name 'cos it can get a bit boring.  So, I decided to let Nethack choose my
character class each time.  I would expect this choice to be random, but now
after quite a few (probably well over a hundred) the choice doesn't seem to be
all that random.  I haven't bothered to actually go through the logfile and
work out an actual distribution, but the most common choice seems to be
Barbarian, least common being Rogues, Tourists and Healers.  The fact that I
generally get much further with Barbarians than Healers and thus those games
are more memorable may have something to do with it, but I am still wondering
whether the choice is truly random?


